    "relationship": {
      "statement": "A pendulum's swing period depends on its length and gravity, not on its bob mass or small starting angle. Longer strings take more time per swing, while larger starting angles only make the swing wider.",
      "formula": "T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{L / g}",
      "assumptions": [
